          {
            "id": "REF-2",
            "text": "## [REF-2] How long refunds take after initiation\nRefunds go back to the original payment method. Timelines are counted in business days from the day the refund is initiated.\n\n| Payment method | Time to reach you |\n| --- | --- |\n| UPI | 1 to 3 business days |\n| Credit or debit card | 5 to 7 business days |\n| Net banking | 3 to 5 business days |\n| ZentroMart Wallet | Instant, within 2 hours |\n| Bank transfer (NEFT) for cash-on-delivery orders | 5 to 7 business days |\n| ZentroMart Wallet for cash-on-delivery orders | Instant, within 2 hours |",
            "file": "pol_refunds.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-06-15",
            "version": "2.1",
            "title": "How long refunds take after initiation"
          },
          {
            "id": "REF-3",
            "text": "## [REF-3] Cash-on-delivery refunds\nFor cash-on-delivery orders, the customer chooses either ZentroMart Wallet (instant) or a bank transfer. Bank transfers start only after the bank account details are verified, then take 5 to 7 business days.",
            "file": "pol_refunds.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-06-15",
            "version": "2.1",
            "title": "Cash-on-delivery refunds"
          },
          {
            "id": "KB-00.3",
            "text": "## [KB-00.3] Business days\nA business day is Monday to Saturday, excluding the warehouse holidays below. Refund and logistics timelines are counted in business days. Return windows are counted in calendar days.\n\n| Date | Holiday |\n| --- | --- |\n| 2026-08-15 | Independence Day |\n| 2026-10-02 | Gandhi Jayanti |\n| 2026-10-19 | Warehouse closure (festival) |\n| 2026-11-09 | Warehouse closure (festival) |",
            "file": "00_about_this_knowledge_base.md",
            "doc_type": "meta",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "1.2",
            "title": "Business days"
          },
          {
            "id": "DEL-3",
            "text": "## [DEL-3] Delivery attempts\nThe courier makes up to 3 delivery attempts. After a failed attempt the customer gets an SMS to reschedule. If the third attempt fails, the parcel is returned to the warehouse (return to origin, RTO) and REF-1 applies.",
            "file": "pol_delivery_shipping.md",
